sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Server
  C->>S: SYN (seq=x)
  S-->>C: SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)
  C->>S: ACK (ack=y+1) [can carry data]
  Note over C,S: ESTABLISHED: 1 RTT before first request
  C->>S: FIN
  S-->>C: ACK
  S->>C: FIN
  C-->>S: ACK (client enters TIME_WAIT ~2×MSL)